│  a repository marked PARTIAL covers most of the core job.                   │
│    5: No free substitute, no free product, and free coverage settled, and   │
│  every repository marked PARTIAL covers only a separable part of the core   │
│  job, with at least 1 such repository in the evidence.                      │
│                                                                             │
│  The confidence inputs are counted, not judged, and a guardrail recomputes  │
│  every one of them from the findings above and rejects a mismatch. Set      │
│  market_coverage to min(1, market sources / 5), sentiment_coverage to       │
