│  2026–2033\n\n6.8%\n\n## **Elevators Market Summary**\n\nThe global         │
│  elevators market size was valued at USD 82.4 billion in 2025 and is        │
│  projected to grow from USD 86.3 billion in 2026 to USD 136.9 billion by    │
│  2033, at a CAGR of 6.8% from 2026 to 2033. Asia Pacific dominated the      │
│  market, accounting for the largest share of 41.7% in 2025. The market is   │
